## 🔧 Standard Functions

### **Required Functions for All Demos:**

```javascript
// 1. Load available LLMs (Category A & B)
async function loadAvailableLLMs() { /* Implementation above */ }

// 2. Open LLM configuration (All categories)
function openLLMConfig() {
    window.open('/', '_blank');
}

// 3. Initialize page LLM loading (All categories)
window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    loadAvailableLLMs();
});

// 4. Error handling wrapper (Recommended)
async function safeApiCall(url, options = {}) {
    try {
        const response = await fetch(url, options);
        if (!response.ok) {
            throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}: ${response.statusText}`);
        }
        return await response.json();
    } catch (error) {
        console.error(`API call failed for ${url}:`, error);
        throw error;
    }
}
```

